# batch given back as its sorted runs (osfmk/arm64/hosted/free_report_runs.h = runtime/xnuhost/include/xnuhost/
# free_report_runs.h). A fourth oneios-mem: line splits the give-back time: lock waits, taking, host calls, putting back,
